  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 9.74,
      "e": 12.98,
      "text": "The Sandy category one, this is the final flight more than likely."
    },
    {
      "s": 12.98,
      "e": 16.78,
      "text": "We do have another flight that is scheduled to go behind us."
    },
    {
      "s": 16.78,
      "e": 20.42,
      "text": "We have every ounce of fuel on the aircraft that we can actually squeeze on."
    },
    {
      "s": 20.42,
      "e": 22.78,
      "text": "So, because we know we're going to be out there a long time."
    },
    {
      "s": 22.78,
      "e": 25.14,
      "text": "We'll pass our last fix."
    },
    {
      "s": 25.14,
      "e": 29.1,
      "text": "So, the mission purpose today is to go out and fix Sandy and stay in the environment"
    },
    {
      "s": 29.1,
      "e": 30.42,
      "text": "as long as humanly possible."
    },
    {
      "s": 30.42,
      "e": 33.82,
      "text": "We will leave more than likely when we hit bingo fuel."
    },
    {
      "s": 33.82,
      "e": 38.06,
      "text": "So, now if you keep me posted on that as the day goes and then we'll bug out when we hit"
    },
    {
      "s": 38.06,
      "e": 39.06,
      "text": "that point."
    },
    {
      "s": 39.06,
      "e": 41.46,
      "text": "It's going to be a very long mission."
    },
    {
      "s": 41.46,
      "e": 43.94,
      "text": "Maintenance status, as far as the aircraft, it's 5308."
    },
    {
      "s": 43.94,
      "e": 45.9,
      "text": "It does have max gas."
    },
    {
      "s": 45.9,
      "e": 47.62,
      "text": "The weather out there, it's obviously a hurricane."
    },
    {
      "s": 47.62,
      "e": 48.62,
      "text": "We are teal 73."
    },
    {
      "s": 48.62,
      "e": 50.78,
      "text": "Our time today, we're here already."
    },
    {
      "s": 50.78,
      "e": 54.26,
      "text": "Our takeoff time is 1545 zulilil, 1145 local."
    },
    {
      "s": 54.26,
      "e": 56.46,
      "text": "We'll call stations at 1115 local."
    },
    {
      "s": 56.46,
      "e": 58.14,
      "text": "That gives us two hours from now."
    },
    {
      "s": 58.14,
      "e": 62.46,
      "text": "So, we've got plenty of time to take care of anything in the last minute plan."
    },
    {
      "s": 62.46,
      "e": 64.7,
      "text": "Take care of yourself or anything like that."
    },
    {
      "s": 64.7,
      "e": 65.7,
      "text": "Come home earlier or anything like that."
    },
    {
      "s": 65.7,
      "e": 68.02,
      "text": "If we have a maintenance issue or any type of emergency procedure, we'll have to go"
    },
    {
      "s": 68.02,
      "e": 69.02,
      "text": "ahead and fix."
    },
    {
      "s": 69.02,
      "e": 72.82,
      "text": "If you heads down or heads up any time we're taxing out to the police, let the other pilot"
    },
    {
      "s": 72.82,
      "e": 74.62,
      "text": "know so we can make sure on the flight deck as well."
    },
    {
      "s": 74.62,
      "e": 76.62,
      "text": "It's looking out for clearing."
    },
    {
      "s": 76.62,
      "e": 79.02,
      "text": "Transfer of aircraft control, let's make that as positive as possible."
    },
    {
      "s": 79.02,
      "e": 80.02,
      "text": "You have the aircraft right."
    },
    {
      "s": 80.02,
      "e": 83.54,
      "text": "Let's keep it as quiet as possible, especially when we're in the radar environment and let's"
    },
    {
      "s": 83.54,
      "e": 85.54,
      "text": "be listening up because we're going to be up in New York sector."
    },
    {
      "s": 85.54,
      "e": 88.22,
      "text": "So, it'll be a lot of talk on radios and air-align activity."
    },
    {
      "s": 88.22,
      "e": 91.66,
      "text": "So, there'll be very few of us out there flying today."
    },
    {
      "s": 91.66,
      "e": 93.02,
      "text": "Do we know if no is out there?"
    },
    {
      "s": 93.02,
      "e": 94.02,
      "text": "We're alone."
    },
    {
      "s": 94.02,
      "e": 95.02,
      "text": "All alone or no?"
    },
    {
      "s": 95.02,
      "e": 96.9,
      "text": "Okay, that's how I like it."
    },
    {
      "s": 130.23,
      "e": 135.51,
      "text": "We make it 75-mile lakes in order to have, as it gets closer to land, of course, we're"
    },
    {
      "s": 135.51,
      "e": 139.27,
      "text": "going to have to modify the pattern so we stay out over water."
    },
    {
      "s": 139.27,
      "e": 143.19,
      "text": "So, total will be flexible if they want longer lakes anywhere."
    },
    {
      "s": 143.19,
      "e": 144.35,
      "text": "We'll give them that."
    },
    {
      "s": 144.35,
      "e": 150.35,
      "text": "We'll be doing drop size in the eye and also in the maximum bags."
    },
    {
      "s": 150.35,
      "e": 151.35,
      "text": "Slightly elevated."
    },
    {
      "s": 151.35,
      "e": 154.19,
      "text": "I want everybody to review this."
    },
    {
      "s": 154.19,
      "e": 156.19,
      "text": "Take everybody's good on the ORM."
    },
    {
      "s": 156.19,
      "e": 158.19,
      "text": "They've all signed up on it."
    },
    {
      "s": 158.19,
      "e": 160.71,
      "text": "The flight plane looks good."
    },
    {
      "s": 160.71,
      "e": 162.91,
      "text": "Ben Monichie talked to us about the whiskey areas and all."
    },
    {
      "s": 162.91,
      "e": 164.71,
      "text": "Give us a heads up what's going on."
    },
    {
      "s": 164.71,
      "e": 165.71,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "s": 165.71,
      "e": 166.71,
      "text": "Check it out."
    },
    {
      "s": 166.71,
      "e": 169.95,
      "text": "The original plane has kind of going way out to the east to enter from the southeast."
    },
    {
      "s": 169.95,
      "e": 174.39,
      "text": "But now that the new plane is entered, 150 from the southwest, it kind of shortens things"
    },
    {
      "s": 174.39,
      "e": 177.19,
      "text": "up, which is good for us to say so on the gas."
    },
    {
      "s": 177.19,
      "e": 181.83,
      "text": "So, guys, Charleston, the jet routes jumping off at Wilmington, North Carolina."
    },
    {
      "s": 181.83,
      "e": 185.23,
      "text": "We're going to have a direct fix on a jet our way out here."
    },
    {
      "s": 185.23,
      "e": 188.43,
      "text": "Just east of the outer banks as their decent point."
    },
    {
      "s": 188.43,
      "e": 196.23,
      "text": "Right now, Sandy is centered right here oddly enough at the Raleigh intersection."
    },
    {
      "s": 196.23,
      "e": 197.23,
      "text": "Wow."
    },
    {
      "s": 197.23,
      "e": 203.27,
      "text": "Which is just about 200 miles east of Norfolk."
    },
    {
      "s": 203.27,
      "e": 205.11,
      "text": "So the first leg is 150."
    },
    {
      "s": 205.11,
      "e": 207.59,
      "text": "So, plenty of time to do what they need."
    },
    {
      "s": 207.59,
      "e": 212.55,
      "text": "And then it's just about a two hour jog back to Savannah after we're done."
    },
    {
      "s": 212.55,
      "e": 213.55,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "s": 213.55,
      "e": 214.55,
      "text": "All right."
    },
    {
      "s": 214.55,
      "e": 217.55,
      "text": "If anybody didn't catch up, Raleigh, that is Val's husband's name."
    },
    {
      "s": 217.55,
      "e": 219.63,
      "text": "So, that'll be where we're at."
    },
    {
      "s": 219.63,
      "e": 220.63,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "s": 220.63,
      "e": 222.39,
      "text": "So, Bingo fuel is a big thing."
    },
    {
      "s": 222.39,
      "e": 223.39,
      "text": "Everybody be ready for changes on the flight plan."
    },
    {
      "s": 223.39,
      "e": 226.11,
      "text": "We're going to be changing up a lot because I'm sure they're going to want some different"
    },
    {
      "s": 226.11,
      "e": 228.07,
      "text": "things as we're making close to landfall."
    },
    {
      "s": 228.07,
      "e": 231.07,
      "text": "So, buckle down and tell us to get a signal."
    },
    {
      "s": 231.07,
      "e": 233.07,
      "text": "That's all ahead."
    },
    {
      "s": 233.07,
      "e": 234.07,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "s": 234.07,
      "e": 235.07,
      "text": "Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "s": 235.07,
      "e": 236.07,
      "text": "Ty, do you want anything?"
    },
    {
      "s": 236.07,
      "e": 237.07,
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "s": 237.07,
      "e": 238.07,
      "text": "Nothing to add."
    },
    {
      "s": 238.07,
      "e": 239.07,
      "text": "All right."
    },
    {
      "s": 239.07,
      "e": 240.07,
      "text": "Let's go do it."
    },
    {
      "s": 240.07,
      "e": 242.07,
      "text": "This will be the last one, eight days straight of flying."
    },
    {
      "s": 242.07,
      "e": 244.07,
      "text": "Sandy, and this should be the last mission."
    },
    {
      "s": 244.07,
      "e": 246.07,
      "text": "So, I'm ready to put it to bed and be done with it."
    },
    {
      "s": 246.07,
      "e": 247.07,
      "text": "I know everybody's tired and worn out."
    },
    {
      "s": 247.07,
      "e": 248.07,
      "text": "We're ready to go home."
    },
    {
      "s": 248.07,
      "e": 249.07,
      "text": "That's it."
    },
    {
      "s": 249.07,
      "e": 250.07,
      "text": "Oh, PFD's and true."
    },
    {
      "s": 250.07,
      "e": 256.96,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "s": 256.96,
      "e": 257.96,
      "text": "Oh, T-A-R-A."
    },
    {
      "s": 257.96,
      "e": 265.14,
      "text": "T-A-S, motor set."
    },
    {
      "s": 265.14,
      "e": 266.14,
      "text": "Active route is set."
    },
    {
      "s": 266.14,
      "e": 269.9,
      "text": "I'm not sure if we skipped the radar step, but it's set for my tilt."
    },
    {
      "s": 269.9,
      "e": 270.9,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "s": 270.9,
      "e": 271.9,
      "text": "We may have radar set power."
    },
    {
      "s": 271.9,
      "e": 272.9,
      "text": "Go."
    },
    {
      "s": 272.9,
      "e": 273.9,
      "text": "Sorry."
    },
    {
      "s": 273.9,
      "e": 274.9,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "s": 275.9,
      "e": 278.9,
      "text": "T-C-S, motor set."
    },
    {
      "s": 278.9,
      "e": 280.9,
      "text": "Above and below."
    },
    {
      "s": 280.9,
      "e": 281.9,
      "text": "T-A-R-A."
    },
    {
      "s": 281.9,
      "e": 284.9,
      "text": "Active route is set."
    },
    {
      "s": 284.9,
      "e": 285.9,
      "text": "Left mode panel."
    },
    {
      "s": 285.9,
      "e": 287.9,
      "text": "Timeter is set."
    },
    {
      "s": 287.9,
      "e": 288.9,
      "text": "Tech-ans."
    },
    {
      "s": 288.9,
      "e": 291.9,
      "text": "There's nobody else out here."
    },
    {
      "s": 291.9,
      "e": 292.9,
      "text": "It's set."
    },
    {
      "s": 292.9,
      "e": 293.9,
      "text": "Radios."
    },
    {
      "s": 293.9,
      "e": 297.14,
      "text": "We got giant killer and Victor II."
    },
    {
      "s": 297.14,
      "e": 298.14,
      "text": "Who is it?"
    },
    {
      "s": 298.14,
      "e": 301.03,
      "text": "Victor, 126.2."
    },
    {
      "s": 301.03,
      "e": 302.03,
      "text": "Now it's back at."
    },
    {
      "s": 302.03,
      "e": 303.03,
      "text": "What you've been dinky?"
    },
    {
      "s": 303.03,
      "e": 304.03,
      "text": "Yeah, it's Savannah."
    },
    {
      "s": 304.03,
      "e": 306.03,
      "text": "Watch my dinky huh?"
    },
    {
      "s": 306.03,
      "e": 309.03,
      "text": "Yeah it's a fan, I'm 36C, I said 2345 in there."
    },
    {
      "s": 309.03,
      "e": 311.03,
      "text": "Yeah let's put 243 nothin' in."
    },
    {
      "s": 311.03,
      "e": 314.03,
      "text": "You won, I'm gonna put that up there just so we'll have it."
    },
    {
      "s": 314.03,
      "e": 322.3,
      "text": "Alright, pretty low."
    },
    {
      "s": 322.3,
      "e": 324.3,
      "text": "Wait, see an 800 foot difference?"
    },
    {
      "s": 324.3,
      "e": 325.3,
      "text": "Yeah, this is what cross-a-8 is."
    },
    {
      "s": 325.3,
      "e": 326.3,
      "text": "Yeah, tell them."
    },
    {
      "s": 326.3,
      "e": 328.3,
      "text": "We're gonna go up to flight level 100."
    }
